**Enqueuing pre-abort events**
The focused tests pass. I also found an interruption race: an abort response can resolve before the adapter processes preceding `message_end` events. I’m adding a queue-drain receipt before forced completion so interruption retains that usage. This needs one internal `PiRpcClient` message type; compaction behavior and its public API remain unchanged.
